{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WOODLINS is a relaxing idle game about collecting\u00a0a variety of woodland-inspired creatures that accompanies you during your daily life, whether you're relaxing, studying, working, streaming, or even playing other games! Discover new <strong>Woodlins</strong>, build them a <strong>beautiful home</strong>, <strong>interact</strong> with them, or leave them to hop around and earn coins\u00a0<strong>while you do other things</strong>, all tucked away at the <strong>edge of your screen</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/Gif_ScreenPositions-ezgif.com.gif?t=1749769928\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Woodlins and their home a variety of items, buildings, and decorations! Build the perfect cozy home for all your Woodlins to relax!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/Gif_Customize-ezgif.com.gif?t=1749769928\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more of the world as you play to expand your Woodlins' home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/Gif_UnlockLand.gif?t=1749769928\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the perfect home for all your Woodlins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle window mode lets your Woodlins chill on the edge of your screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Woodlins with tonnes of accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable day-night cycle and weather (both can be set to match real world)!</p></li></ul>","ba